{#
    One file on a page of its own: its facts, its preview and its public address (003-003-0002).

    IT IS A SECOND ROUTE ON THE SAME MOUNT, not a view of its own area — `AdminManager` declares
    why (ADR 0022). For this template that only matters in one place: every address it prints
    comes ready-made from `FileController`, the rule the listing follows for the same reason.

    THE WAY BACK IS ALWAYS THERE. It leads into the folder the file lies in, or to the listing
    root when it lies outside the folders — derived from the record and not from history, so it
    works for somebody who arrived from a bookmark.

    THE FOLDER LINE HAS THREE REASONS TO CARRY NO LINK, and the missing right is checked first.
    Measured, after the other order was written here: without the right to read folders the core
    leaves the masked join empty, so a file inside a folder looks exactly like one outside them —
    and this page said „Ausserhalb der Ordner" about it. A missing right takes an answer away
    (ADR 0019); it must not produce a different, wrong one.

    THE PREVIEW IS EITHER AN IMAGE OR A LABEL, never an empty box — the listing's rule, and for
    its reason: a preview that failed to load and a file that was never going to have one must
    not look the same. `admin/file-preview` swaps a missing derivative for the original, because
    whether the configured alias exists cannot be found out from the package (Schema-Vertrag L25).

    THE PUBLIC ADDRESS IS STATED, AND SO IS WHAT IT MEANS. The core serves every stored file
    under this route without asking for a login (Schema-Vertrag L23). An editor who hands the
    address on should know that, and a page that shows the address while staying silent about it
    would be the worse of the two options.
#}{% extends 'layout.html.twig' %}

{% block bodyAttributes %} class="admin"{% endblock %}

{% block content %}
<main class="admin__main admin-file">
    <nav class="admin-files__trail" aria-label="Ordnerpfad">
        <a class="admin-files__trail-link" href="{{ rootUrl }}">Alle Dateien</a>
{% if folderUrl %}
        <span class="admin-files__trail-separator" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <a class="admin-files__trail-link" href="{{ folderUrl }}">{{ folderTitle }}</a>
{% endif %}
        <span class="admin-files__trail-separator" aria-hidden="true">/</span>
        <span class="admin-files__trail-link admin-files__trail-link--current" aria-current="true">{{ name }}</span>
    </nav>

    <h1>{{ name }}</h1>

    <div class="admin-file__layout">
        <div class="admin-file__preview-box">
{% if preview %}
            <img class="admin-file__preview" src="{{ preview }}" alt=""
                 decoding="async"
                 data-controller="admin-file-preview"
                 data-admin-file-preview-fallback-value="{{ original }}">
{% else %}
            <span class="admin-file__preview admin-file__preview--badge"
                  role="img" aria-label="{{ type }}">{{ badge }}</span>
{% endif %}
        </div>

        <dl class="admin-file__facts">
            <dt class="admin-file__term">Name</dt>
            <dd class="admin-file__value">{{ name }}</dd>

            <dt class="admin-file__term">Ordner</dt>
            <dd class="admin-file__value">
{% if folderUrl %}
                <a href="{{ folderUrl }}">{{ folderTitle }}</a>
{% elseif not mayReadFolders %}
                <span class="admin-file__muted">Nicht einsehbar — es fehlt das Recht, Ordner zu lesen.</span>
{% elseif isRoot %}
                Ausserhalb der Ordner
{% else %}
                <span class="admin-file__muted">Der Ordner ist nicht mehr vorhanden.</span>
{% endif %}
            </dd>

            <dt class="admin-file__term">Typ</dt>
            <dd class="admin-file__value">{{ type }}</dd>

            <dt class="admin-file__term">Größe</dt>
            <dd class="admin-file__value">{{ size }}</dd>

            <dt class="admin-file__term">Hochgeladen</dt>
            <dd class="admin-file__value">{{ created }}</dd>

            <dt class="admin-file__term">Adresse der Datei</dt>
            <dd class="admin-file__value">
                <a class="admin-file__address" href="{{ original }}">{{ original }}</a>
                <span class="admin-file__muted">Diese Adresse ist ohne Anmeldung abrufbar.</span>
            </dd>
        </dl>
    </div>
</main>
{% endblock %}
